换取票据按客户端 IP 限流，同一个 IP 1 分钟内最多换 10 次。有密码的房间还按房间限制校验密码的次数，1 分钟内最多 20 次，所以换着 IP 猜同一个房间的密码也会受限。房间的额度用完之后，输对密码也换不到票据。

-- request --
POST /api/members

{}
-- response --
201
{"memberToken": "$alice", "member": {"id": "$aliceId", "name": "$guestName", "avatarHash": ""}}

-- request --
POST /api/rooms

{"name": "上锁", "description": "", "password": "芝麻开门"}
-- response --
201
Location: /api/rooms/$locked
{"id": "$locked"}

-- request --
POST /api/rooms/$locked/tickets
Authorization: Bearer $alice
X-Forwarded-For: 198.51.100.7

{"password": "芝麻关门"}
-- response --
401
{"error": {"code": "UNAUTHORIZED", "message": "房间密码错误"}}

